title Library Circulation

component circulation-webapp as "Circulation Web App" web-application
component circulation-api as "Circulation API" service
component catalogue-service as "Catalogue Service" service

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> circulation-webapp
north -> circulation-api
west -> catalogue-service

circulation-webapp -> circulation-api
circulation-webapp -> user-auth
circulation-api -> catalogue-service
circulation-api -> user-auth
